WEBVTT

00:10:28.427 --> 00:10:31.648
I draw my circle of chalk on the pavement

00:10:31.648 --> 00:10:36.491
and enter as the improvising comic silent character

00:10:36.491 --> 00:10:38.416
I created 45 years ago,

00:10:38.416 --> 00:10:42.463
I am as happy as when I am in the clouds.

00:10:42.463 --> 00:10:44.418
But this here,

00:10:44.418 --> 00:10:46.749
this is not the street.

00:10:46.749 --> 00:10:49.325
So I cannot street juggle here, you understand.

00:10:49.325 --> 00:10:51.498
So you don't want me to street juggle here, right?

00:10:51.498 --> 00:10:52.864
You know that, right?

00:10:52.864 --> 00:10:55.113
You don't want me to juggle, right?

00:10:55.113 --> 00:10:57.406
(Applause)